  "body": "Chrome and Firefox now support `<link rel=preconnect>`, which performs the dns/tcp/tls handshakes with the specified origin. However, today there is no way to perform this operation from a Worker - e.g. my SW wants to initiate a preconnect in anticipation of an upcoming request.\n\nCan we express this via Fetch? Should it be a separate API?\n\nParent bug: https://github.com/w3c/resource-hints/issues/36\n",
